1
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:04,320
What was your team hoping
to find here in Pompeii?

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,140
I'll never tell a scum like you.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,440
That's so. What a shame.

4
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,597
But they're still your two friends.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:15,017
I'm sure one of them could be
persuaded into spilling their guts.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,260
Which makes you WORTHLESS!

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,640
Those footsteps.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,588
Someone's running around
outside the mirror.

9
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,100
Well now, would you look at that?

10
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:34,301
Could it be your friends dumped you in favor
of pursuing their precious secret item?

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,376
The trail of sound is heading
towards the Kaveh Kanam.

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,876
There's no question.

13
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,377
Killing you isn't worth the
effort it'd take to do it.

14
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:46,877
I think I'll go snatch whatever
it is you're so keen on finding!

15
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,790
No!

16
00:00:47,873 --> 00:00:49,109
You're not going anywhere!

17
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,800
Abakio! Giorno!

18
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:06,960
Where is it?

19
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:08,280
Where's the key?

20
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:15,800
Aha, gotcha.

21
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,470
Huh?

22
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,590
A mirror?

23
00:01:20,673 --> 00:01:22,360
It's not from around here.

24
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:25,257
What's that you got there?

25
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:26,460
A key?

26
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,150
Heavens me!

27
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:33,617
This is gonna be like taking
candy from a washed-up baby!

28
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:34,530
You see?

29
00:01:34,613 --> 00:01:35,443
What now?

30
00:01:35,526 --> 00:01:38,060
Try as you might, you can't unsee me!

31
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:42,040
The die has been cast
and your fate is sealed!

32
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,820
Let's go.

33
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:03,577
I'll see you

34
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:10,660
next

35
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:12,750
time.

36
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,600
Oh, shit, not good!

37
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:23,477
I'm starting to understand how this
Katsune messes with people's heads.

38
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,501
So he's hiding inside the mirror.

39
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:29,018
And logically speaking, that
can only mean one thing.

40
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:33,002
That reflective reject must have
dragged Fugo into a mirror world,

41
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:36,151
effectively separating him from his stand.

42
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:39,620
It's a shame, but the key comes first!

43
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:45,760
Your breaking the mirror just
made my job that much easier.

44
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:49,497
Reflections act as portals
to the mirror world.

45
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:54,317
By breaking it into pieces, you practically
handed me your life on a silver platter.

46
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:59,520
I shall grant you exclusive access to
my world, but only your physical self.

47
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,860
Gotcha now.

48
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,137
You're gonna be stuck in here for life.

49
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:06,279
But first, I'll be taking that key.

50
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,557
How the hell are you?

51
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:14,940
Y-you can only do this
with the power of a stand!

52
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:18,780
I dragged you in here alone!

53
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:21,780
There's no way you can
be choking Mirror Man!

54
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:25,197
Guess breaking that mirror
wasn't such a mistake after all.

55
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:28,677
Your view of the outside world
just got a whole lot narrower.

56
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,780
You did drag something in here.

57
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,620
Problem is, you can't see!

58
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,100
You gave me access.

59
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:36,917
But just for my physical self?!

60
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,780
Wait, is that...

61
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,640
Thanks for making my job easier.

62
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:44,940
Moody Jazz!

63
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,860
I pulled in his stand!

64
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:57,920
Inside the mirror,
everything is ass backwards.

65
00:04:58,740 --> 00:05:01,837
It's almost impossible to
figure out that trick until

66
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,802
the bastard decides to
attack you with his stand.

67
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:07,480
Fugo must be somewhere in here too.

68
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:10,557
But how the hell do we
get out of this place?

69
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:14,440
If I have to massacre your
ass to escape, then so be it!

70
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,717
You're about to get a first-hand look at

71
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:19,437
why I sent Moody Jazz
into your mirror prison!

72
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:23,180
So your power is an anthropomorphic
shape-shifting stand.

73
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:26,180
Well done, Stronto. You got me.

74
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:43,597
You know, when all is said and done, your
wimpy little stand is pretty damn feeble.

75
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,697
You're screwed unless you're
fighting a total weakling.

76
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:49,760
Well, come on, let's get this over with.

77
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,517
Hey, didn't I already tell you?

78
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:56,306
You're as good as dead,
my long-haired friend.

79
00:05:56,700 --> 00:06:00,257
You managed to startle me slightly
when you showed up with a stand,

80
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,811
but you're still a goner.

81
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:04,897
Did it occur to you that
I'm crouching for a reason?

82
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:07,568
I'm doing it because I
have no other choice!

83
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:08,610
Obviously.

84
00:06:08,693 --> 00:06:12,268
You're hunched over to give my
foot a clear path to your gut.

85
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:20,477
Actually, I was crouching so I
could pick up this shard of mirror.

86
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,837
Hey, what's with the bewildered face?

87
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,940
Does this arm scare you?

88
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:28,120
I think you of all people
would recognize it.

89
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:32,960
I told you from the beginning, reflections
serve as portals to another world.

90
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:38,080
By using a piece of glass to capture your
reflection, I created another portal.

91
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,460
Do you get it?

92
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:42,417
I dragged something special
into this mirror world.

93
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,060
Your stinking arm!

94
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,720
We wouldn't want you to get too excited.

95
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:51,220
So only half your body was
allowed into this world.

96
00:06:51,860 --> 00:06:55,507
As for your stand here, I'll be
nice and let half of it leave.

97
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:59,520
I've got you and your stand
exactly where I want you.

98
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:01,320
That key is mine.

99
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,870
Shit.

100
00:07:03,953 --> 00:07:06,096
All that work and there goes the key.

101
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:08,517
That means not only did
I botch the mission,

102
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:11,776
but everything Giorno predicted
is about to come true.

103
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:13,617
I'm not leaving.

104
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:14,700
Trust me on this.

105
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:18,897
Finding Fugo and taking this guy down will
be our best shot at solving this mystery.

106
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:23,320
I might be down right now, but
I still have my pride, damn it.

107
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,580
He's not getting that damn key.

108
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:29,180
I swear on all that's holy.

109
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:33,480
I, Leone Abacchio, will
never give up this key.

110
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:41,817
Since Mirror Man focuses on dragging
fools like you into the Netherrealm,

111
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:46,337
it doesn't have much in the way of brute
force, but I'm well aware of its strengths.

112
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:47,560
For instance,

113
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:49,757
in a compromising position such as this,

114
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:53,677
it doesn't need the power of a superhuman
to finish off the likes of you!

115
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,590
In fact,

116
00:07:54,673 --> 00:07:58,977
a four-year-old could slide this shard
down your gullet without breaking a sweat.

117
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:00,560
Ah, sweet victory!

118
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:03,979
Thanks for showing me exactly
where to find s - huh?

119
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,671
What are you waiting for?

120
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:14,220
Hurry up and do it!

121
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:17,040
Explain yourself, Abakio.

122
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,637
You really think you can hide it from me?

123
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:23,477
Even if you can move your body, you
won't be able to escape me, you know.

124
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:26,640
I can see right through
you. Got that? Hide what?

125
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,697
What the hell are you talking about?

126
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:31,192
You're not making the least bit of sense.

127
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:40,160
Your bad acting isn't fooling anyone.

128
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,980
Now, show me your hand!

129
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,386
How are you doing this,
you freaking bastardo?

130
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,540
What, did you lose something?

131
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,620
Why so quiet?

132
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:55,240
I asked a question. Well?

133
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:57,858
Why would he do something like that?

134
00:08:58,520 --> 00:08:59,350
Shit.

135
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,637
If this fool really chopped off his hand,

136
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:05,140
then the stand's hand that's
outside the mirror is...

137
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:06,980
It can't be.

138
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,180
The hand's gone.

139
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,460
His area.

140
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,780
No, it has the key.

141
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:21,677
And it's going back damn it the key
is getting away and that new recruit?

142
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:25,517
Giorno is just around the
corner he cut off his own hand

143
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,657
just to give him the key
should have killed me with that

144
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:31,477
piece of glass back when you
had a chance had you just done

145
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:35,031
that my stand's hand would have
dropped dead in its tracks?

146
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,237
Close but no cigar!

147
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:43,857
Too bad this is the sound of
your dreams disintegrating.

148
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:46,560
You'll pick up that key any second now!

149
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:54,077
Shape-shifting bastardo did you really
think i'd let that brat Giorno off the hook?

150
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:58,537
I'll just drag his ass
in here too so Giorno

151
00:09:58,620 --> 00:10:01,320
do you finally get what
it's all about now?

152
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:05,777
As long as one of us gets
back with the key we're good.

153
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:09,500
Even if the one who does is
a piece of shit like you.

154
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:14,459
The only thing that matters is
successfully carrying out the mission.

155
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:22,877
Wow your thoughts are so loud I
can practically hear them Abakio?

156
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:26,960
Do you actually believe you know
what's going on outside the mirror?

157
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:31,117
If nothing else at least you have a loyal

158
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:34,097
partner it's a shame he's
not the brightest bulb.

159
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:37,037
He's throwing away all your hard work but

160
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,708
don't take my word for
it look for yourself.

161
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:44,357
The fool's not even attempting to
flee with the key seems he's decided

162
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:49,260
to stay put i suppose the But the
stress of the mission got to him!

163
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:54,930
Giorno!

164
00:10:55,013 --> 00:10:55,843
What are you doing?

165
00:10:55,926 --> 00:10:56,756
Move your ass!

166
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,040
You have the key!

167
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,477
Get out of there now!

168
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:02,117
You can scream until
you're even more purple.

169
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,435
He'll never hear you.

170
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,151
Is this really happening?

171
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:10,180
I now have two options at my disposal.

172
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:14,777
I could secure the key, then finish
off Giorno while basking in my victory.

173
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:18,300
Or I could lacerate his
trachea and major arteries,

174
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:21,754
watch him bleed out, then
collect the key at my leisure.

175
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:23,920
Now, what to do?

176
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:29,345
I think it's the perfect day for
slicing open this pug's throat!

177
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:31,460
Oh, he noticed me!

178
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:34,779
I guess I'll let him in,
but only his physical self.

179
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,960
Welcome to my world!

180
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,160
Slice away, Mirror Man!

181
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:45,997
Wh-what?!

182
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,820
No way, that's impossible!

183
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,140
It's the virus!

184
00:11:50,420 --> 00:11:51,877
Damn that Giorno to hell!

185
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:54,725
He got himself infected
by Fugo's purple smoke!

186
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:57,140
The key stays with me, asshat.

187
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:59,877
And mark my words, before I'm done,

188
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,901
I'll bring back Fugo and
Abbacchio safe and south!

189
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:14,780
Damn that Giorno Giovanna.

190
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:17,500
He's an arrogant, ignorant prick.

191
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:21,800
Purple smoke will turn him into
human fertilizer before he knows it.

192
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:26,135
I'll never forget part of me
died on that horrible day.

193
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,480
It left me completely numb.

194
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:33,080
The thought of losing a limb
doesn't scare me in the least.

195
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:37,357
The only thing that brings
me solace now is carrying

196
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:40,499
out the orders of an
omnipotent and powerful leader.

197
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:45,540
Devoting myself to this mission has
given my miserable life new purpose.

198
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:50,880
Put simply, my orders were to
retrieve the key and protect the girl.

199
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:54,166
Completing the mission
meant everything to me.

200
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:55,820
And yet Giorno,

201
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:57,680
the Chiricolione,

202
00:12:57,980 --> 00:13:00,360
instead of getting the key back safely,

203
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:03,840
he decided to risk the whole
plan to save me and Fugo.

204
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:07,920
Stupid brat, how dare you bring
that filthy disease in here?

205
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:10,000
Are you out of your mind?

206
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:16,960
You Goldilocks goon, you infected me!

207
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:21,017
Ah, you have the same nasty symptoms I do.

208
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:26,240
It takes about 30 seconds for Purple
Smoke's virus to infect the entire body.

209
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:28,040
Your life is over now.

210
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:30,457
The writing was already
on the wall when you

211
00:13:30,540 --> 00:13:33,011
decided to pull me into your mirror world.

212
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,660
The mirror that Purple
Smoke smashed to pieces.

213
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:41,380
Giorno fixed some shards when
the enemy chased after Abbacchio.

214
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,546
He took some shards with him.

215
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:46,104
Giorno must have realized that.

216
00:13:46,660 --> 00:13:49,484
That's how he figured out
the enemy's abilities.

217
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,457
He infected himself with the virus,

218
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:54,197
then allowed himself to be
dragged into the mirror.

219
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:57,692
There was no other way to take
down a killer this cunning.

220
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,400
This can't be happening.

221
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,489
Damn you to hell, Stronto.

222
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:05,610
Idiot.

223
00:14:05,693 --> 00:14:07,260
Don't celebrate just yet.

224
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:08,874
I haven't been beaten.

225
00:14:09,100 --> 00:14:12,335
I just need to steal myself
for the end of this battle.

226
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:16,300
Now, mere man, allow me
to leave this hellhole.

227
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:17,740
Me and only me.

228
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,553
However, keep that damn virus contained!

229
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:28,520
No part of my body contaminated
with the virus, so leave!

230
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:34,497
Merda, he's going to isolate the
virus inside the mirror world with us!

231
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:38,577
If that cocky kagagatso can cut off
his own damn hand to get the key,

232
00:14:38,660 --> 00:14:43,240
then you can bet your ass that
I'm willing to do the same thing!

233
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:46,060
Oh, the glorious pain!

234
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:50,636
Giorno, grab him before he gets away!

235
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,560
He's gone.

236
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:58,380
Giorno, he slipped through our fingers.

237
00:14:59,100 --> 00:15:02,300
You risked your life to
come in here, and for what?

238
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:07,780
If he's gone, so's the mirror world.

239
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,597
Almost got me there.

240
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,860
But the joke's on you, assholes.

241
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:19,620
The key to success is mental fortitude.

242
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:21,840
This is simply a setback.

243
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:24,651
I had a hunch he'd leave his mirror world.

244
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:26,624
Though all hope isn't lost yet.

245
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:29,757
He doesn't know it, but his
fate was sealed a while back.

246
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:32,337
By stepping outside his
little mirror dimension,

247
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:35,400
he may have inadvertently
saved my life. Fugo!

248
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:39,677
Now that he's outside the mirror world,
Purple Smoke will be able to follow him!

249
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:40,820
Finish him off!

